  },
  {
    "RowId": 40500,
    "Text": "Protect the Temple Knights!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40501,
    "Text": "Defeat Leophyne!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40502,
    "Text": "Brace yourself against the power of the artifact!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40503,
    "Text": "Protect Tentoawa!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40504,
    "Text": "Give back the cradle or we'll take it back!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40505,
    "Text": "All bluster, as usual. Take it if you dare!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40506,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40507,
    "Text": "Protect the netherling warriors!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40508,
    "Text": "The Zundu! With them by our side, Leophyne won't stand a chance!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40509,
    "Text": "Why must you resist? Succumb to the burden of sleep, and dream eternal."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40510,
    "Text": "Now! Wash away darkness of sleep with sundrop dance!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40511,
    "Text": "Don't just stand there! Kill them!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40512,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, defend our allies over there! I'll take the other side!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40513,
    "Text": "Everyone's awake!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40514,
    "Text": "Mighty Zundu protect netherling warriors! Keep cautious, like gaelicat under stormy skies!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40515,
    "Text": "Heh, now you're all alone. This ends now, Leophyne!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40516,
    "Text": "Why am I cursed with incompetents? Very well...dance with me, Wide Eye!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40517,
    "Text": "I have yet to test the strength granted to me...your strength. Now I shall!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40518,
    "Text": "The artifact isn't for such callous hands!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40519,
    "Text": "The narwhal's blessing is only for those with the heart of a defender!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40520,
    "Text": "Be undone!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40521,
    "Text": "That's it, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40522,
    "Text": "To think it could hold such immense power... Hahaha!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40523,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, we need to split up! You take that side!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40524,
    "Text": "Thank you both! Healing is on the way!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40525,
    "Text": "I am far from finished. You will not withstand this!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40526,
    "Text": "Others are just tools to you. Is that your idea of freedom!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40527,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40528,
    "Text": "I'll protect you...until my last breath!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40529,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40530,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40531,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40532,
    "Text": "Gaaahhh!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40533,
    "Text": "I'm all right. What about Tentoawa!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40534,
    "Text": "You think this piece of wood is for <i>protection</i>? Such a cloying sentiment..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40535,
    "Text": "Cursed insects... You lot, finish them off! Earn your freedom!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40536,
    "Text": "Sundrop dance shall rouse netherling warrior! Protect the sleeper until he awakens!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40537,
    "Text": "It's time for us to protect Tentoawa! We'll get through this together!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40538,
    "Text": "On your feet, Tentoawa! It's your duty as the Wide Eye!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40539,
    "Text": "I owe you all my life. Thank you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40540,
    "Text": "Zundu go to help allies! May zephyr winds guide you to victory!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40541,
    "Text": "No... Sleep is inexorable... How are they doing this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40542,
    "Text": "It's just as I said─sleep is absolute! No living thing can resist its call!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40543,
    "Text": "Witness the sundrop dance! Netherling warriors, awaken!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 40544,
    "Text": "Another one falls. Life is ever so fleeting!"
  },
